{'symbol': 'MPC', 'date': '2021-04-28 15:24:00', 'title': 'MARATHON PETROLEUM CORP. ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'FINDLAY, OHIO, APRIL 28, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF MARATHON PETROLEUM CORP. (NYSE: MPC) HAS DECLARED A DIVIDEND OF $0.58 PER SHARE ON COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE JUNE 10,\xa02021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS MAY 19,\xa02021.'}